    "purpose": "why the C80 future repair does not reach held-out. C80 and held-out are the same 40 tasks (2 vs 1 disjoint demo snapshots per task, same phase positions), and before each update J's loss on that fresh C80 batch is 0.93-1.07x E's on the same batch while the trained batches end at 0.64-0.77x: the gain stays on the contexts trained on, held-out is not a different distribution. Open: is it attached to the context (scene) or to its single sampler-seed trajectory, and how much of a batch's gradient do other contexts and seeds share",
